  "description": "Locale is a powerful multi-format localization library that supports JSON, YAML, RESX, PO/Gettext, XLIFF, SRT, VTT, CSV, i18next JSON, Fluent FTL, and VB resources. It provides services for scanning translation gaps, comparing files, validating against rules, converting between formats, and generating skeleton files for new languages.",
